# 1-based lines to bookmark, one per line. Blank lines and # comments ignored.
#
# Each line sits INSIDE a construct the profile claims to understand, so a
# broken `containers` entry shows up as a missing breadcrumb rather than passing
# unnoticed. Lua's only container kind is `function_declaration` — tables and
# metatables are values, not declarations — so every breadcrumb below names a
# function and nothing deeper exists to assert.

# Inside the `if` in Invoice.new() — the breadcrumb must name the function.
# This is the line that fails if `containers` is wrong.
31

# Inside the `if`/`elseif` chain inside the generic `for` in Invoice:compute()
# — two statement levels, so the breadcrumb walk has to skip both.
49

# Inside the numeric `for` in Invoice:retry(), exercising the other `for`
# spelling and a `variable_declaration` landmark.
67

# Inside the `repeat ... until` body in Invoice:drain().
88

# Inside the bare `do` block. `do_statement` is deliberately unlabelled: no
# entry in codemark's label vocabulary fits a plain block, and the fallback
# renders it "do statement" anyway.
92

# Inside an anonymous `function_definition` bound to a local — the landmark tier
# with no name field of its own, since the name lives on the declaration.
#
# Both this and the next line snapshot an EMPTY breadcrumb, deliberately.
# `function_definition` cannot be a container: it has no name field to read, so
# there is nothing for the walker to show. Pinning the empty value is what keeps
# that distinguishable from `containers` having silently broken.
108

# Inside the same anonymous shape assigned to a table field instead.
113

# Inside the `for` in eachLine(), a `local function` declaration.
121

# NOT bookmarkable, kept here as a record rather than silently omitted:
#
#   36    self.state = state or statuses.draft
#
# The generator emits `name: (dot_index_expression) @fn_name` for the enclosing
# `function Invoice.new`, and tree-sitter rejects it as an impossible pattern —
# that field cannot hold that node type. Reproduces with an empty profile, so no
# curation can fix it. This is codemark#239; re-enable a line here once the
# generator checks the field is valid for the ancestor kind before constraining
# it.
